components.responsibility:
For a root that is a drive letter (a letter, a colon, at most one backslash), W-001 also fails on each gap that Get-WholeDriveReportGaps (pure) finds in the report:
- outcome is not 'completed';
- coverage is null;
- window.CoveragePanel.visible is not true.
It also fails when reasonCodeMismatches > 0 (see the C4 component).

Its wait goes from 1200 s to 3600 s. Every existing check is kept: oracle, controls, CheckPanelAgrees, wcifs-layer-store on.

The record adds, counts only and no panel text:
- outcome;
- coverage: volumeInUse, seenOnDisk, unseen, folders (count), foldersBytes, mftBytes (the bytes of the measured entry whose id is 'mft', else null), measuredBytes, remainder {bytes, includesStore}, and sizeNotRead {files, bytes} or null;
- reasonCodeMismatches;
- oracle.refusedWithAnotherCode.

The record is written once, at the end of the command, to Get-ProofRecordPath. W-001 does not check unseen >= mftBytes, which is open question Q-001. It records both figures so that the C:\ record answers Q-001.

key_decisions.decision:
Each proof source gets one record file under docs/proof-runs:
- w001-<letter>-drive.json for a W-001 drive-letter root;
- w002-rig.json or w002-onedrive.json;
- w003-rig.json or w003-<network>-<link>.json.
-Stopped adds a 'stopped' part to the same W-001 file. Folder roots and UNC share roots keep artifacts/w001-run.json, which is gitignored.

C4 is evidenced in two ways, neither copying UnreadableRows.Reason's wording:
- two text invariants: one reason per code, and a numbered reason names its row's own code;
- an oracle split: a refused code-5 row whose independent open fails with the same code is 'refused', any other failure code is 'refused-another-code'.

proposals.note:
The only proposal, and it is the core. Changes made in composing:
- an oracle class 'refused-another-code' for C4 evidence on C:\;
- pure helpers with Facts for the whole-drive report gaps and the record-path branches;
- the guard written as an architecture rule, with the one-entry seam stated;
- a FETCH_DATA parse Fact, so the rig's only real hydration signal cannot be vacuous;
- the W-003 cut-folder and timing readers made pure and tested.
Its over_engineering_flag was honoured: no schema files, no record index, no churn allowance, no hook change.
